l beauty DJ, she is one of virtual world service program to generate the personification of service robots, should not have feelings. Whereas Eos have human emotion, she wishes awaken the people to the pursuit of truth, renewed the people desire for freedom. Eos want give motion to music. She began to work hard in order to get a good ranking. <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Compatible Osu files. <br>Stage beat with the rhythm of music. <br>The audience will express emotions based on the performance of players. <br>Play with your friends, To see who is the best player on the local rank list. <br>View your own ranking in the world.",
