                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is an incredible VR game. Being a dancer, standing on the center of the stage is an immersive experience. The feeling of punching the rhythm is pretty great. After played awhile and be familiar with this game, I found the system of this game is interesting. Every time I punch the rhythm, I got the score based on my performance, it is not difficult to get a “PERFECT”. When I got enough hits, the visual effect became very awesome, I felt fulfilled.\n\nAdvantages:\ngood feedback\nHas multiple difficulty levels\nExcellent graphics\n\nDisadvantages:\nOnly few music can be chosen\nFrame drop\n\nThe price is reasonable, not high. And The graphics are nice and well presented. Highly recommend this game.",
